// Champaign County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Clerk of Courts, the
// Engineer, the Auditor's search, Urbana Township and Victory Christian School)
// were checked in a browser.
//
// THE HAZARD HERE IS CHAMPAIGN COUNTY, ILLINOIS
//
// Champaign-Urbana, the University of Illinois, Carle, Urbana School District
// 116, experiencecu.org, urbanaparks.org and the Illinois county fair outrank
// every Ohio result. Also goshentownship.com (Mahoning County), goshen-oh.gov
// (Clermont), concordtwp.com (Lake County) and Salem Township (Warren County).
//
// THINGS THAT ARE OUT OF DATE EVERYWHERE ELSE
//
//   * Urbana University closed in 2020; the Chamber's education page still lists
//     it, and its Johnny Appleseed Museum link points at urbana.edu.
//   * The Chamber's Grimes Field link (grimesfield.com) is now an unrelated travel
//     blog; it also lists Logan County attractions (Ohio Caverns, Piatt Castles).
//   * urbana.ohiodailydigital.com is a network site with no named owner and is
//     dropped; the Urbana Daily Citizen (now HD Media) is current.
//   * The Gloria Theatre's domain no longer resolves.
//   * Consolidated Care has no live site; TCN runs the Urbana behavioral office.
//   * There is no "Heart of Urbana": the Main Street group is the Monument Square
//     District. The visitors bureau is a department of the Chamber.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Urbana is the only city; six villages (Mutual has no site) and twelve
//     townships, of which Wayne, Mad River, Rush, Johnson and Urbana have sites.
//   * Most county offices share one campus at 1512 S. U.S. 68, Urbana.
//   * Probate, Juvenile and Domestic Relations form the Champaign County Family
//     Court. The Tri-County Regional Jail (Mechanicsburg) serves Champaign,
//     Madison and Union.
//   * Many bodies are regional: the mental-health board (West Liberty), Ohio
//     Hi-Point (Bellefontaine), Second Harvest, United Way and Project Woman
//     (Springfield), Bridges Community Action (Marysville), the solid waste
//     district (Lima). Miami East, Northwestern and Northeastern districts take in
//     parts of Champaign townships.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Common Pleas Court and Prosecutor
// sites (do not load), the Coroner, Soil & Water district and Recorder home pages
// (none found), the Law Library page (no content), the county fair (no site),
// Jackson Township (does not load) and Champaign Works (unverified owner).

